  "lines": [
    {
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L001",
      "frame_id": "CH03_P04_F00",
      "panel_id": "p34_lotus_council",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "kind": "narration",
      "spoken_text": "One of the leaders of the Living Archive invited Mika and his companions and began his story.",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch03_clips/en/CH03_P04_L001_en.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 6.034,
      "camera_target": [
        0.47,
        0.136,
        0.214
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0,
      "transition_style": "cut",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "ce09ee02f879eece722bd05b7317c6adf041ad5a33d8c302ab6f2f23cbc3f847"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L003",
      "frame_id": "CH03_P04_F01",
      "panel_id": "p34_lotus_council",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "spoken_text": "We are not called Phase Beings by accident. Our lives pass through three states.",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch03_clips/en/CH03_P04_L003_en.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 5.642,
      "camera_target": [
        0.76,
        0.135,
        0.158
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.25,
      "transition_style": "pan",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "60a01c2116a67c798b265543dbfeed7629c9d790e47b5a9dbfb342deb12612e2"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L002",
      "frame_id": "CH03_P04_F00",
      "panel_id": "p34_lotus_council",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_015",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "spoken_text": "Like water?",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch03_clips/en/CH03_P04_L002_en.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 1.489,
      "camera_target": [
        0.49,
        0.131,
        0.155
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.25,
      "transition_style": "pan",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "6d55597200ae8682430f8bb69a1109ff465e571bfb0f40d6f818f7760dff4f25"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L004",
      "frame_id": "CH03_P04_F02",
      "panel_id": "p34_liquid_phase",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "spoken_text": "Not exactly. We are born in a more gaseous state: our molecules are far apart from one another.",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch03_clips/en/CH03_P04_L004_en.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 7.001,
      "camera_target": [
        0.255,
        0.347,
        0.165
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.4,
      "transition_style": "cut",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "f4267ffcc68ef1164d7ca90f0db5bc4dba52b5bf26d66086f81320882b8044dd"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L005",
      "frame_id": "CH03_P04_F03",
      "panel_id": "p34_crystal_phase",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "spoken_text": "Over time we grow denser and take on a liquid or jelly-like form. And at the end of life, we crystallize.",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch03_clips/en/CH03_P04_L005_en.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 7.967,
      "camera_target": [
        0.735,
        0.348,
        0.165
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.4,
      "transition_style": "cut",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "80c2f5b9b296cd8f36d9bf9c21c9ef05b1f7dcce3a9b27a8bbd62ef66ef71b99"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L006",
      "frame_id": "CH03_P04_F04",
      "panel_id": "p34_phase_cavern",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "spoken_text": "According to one of our theories, we descended from ancient cosmic crystals that can even be found on asteroids.",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch03_clips/en/CH03_P04_L006_en.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 6.766,
      "camera_target": [
        0.49,
        0.545,
        0.18
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.4,
      "transition_style": "cut",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "e757bb66b34ea50c6f90bbd7438b9cdb7337bf77885bb6e8565c0358b160fdde"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L007",
      "frame_id": "CH03_P04_F04",
      "panel_id": "p34_phase_cavern",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "spoken_text": "Perhaps that became our misfortune. Other races see the crystals left after us as being just as valuable as the ones mined in space.",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch03_clips/en/CH03_P04_L007_en.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 8.516,
      "camera_target": [
        0.5,
        0.545,
        0.18
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.25,
      "transition_style": "pan",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "3a71a0b8fd069a606dae5966d820ad73d4403c2a5261aca6a6e111106bc7358f"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L008",
      "frame_id": "CH03_P04_F04",
      "panel_id": "p34_phase_cavern",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "spoken_text": "But to us, they are the memory of our ancestors.",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch03_clips/en/CH03_P04_L008_en.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 3.631,
      "camera_target": [
        0.5,
        0.535,
        0.18
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.25,
      "transition_style": "pan",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "3580618b67cff29d0a53ee5b273c22f6ee2deba88a1a806c5cadc252a0345221"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L009",
      "frame_id": "CH03_P04_F05",
      "panel_id": "p34_new_hero",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "spoken_text": "And I want to thank you for helping stop the lizard.",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch03_clips/en/CH03_P04_L009_en.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 3.239,
      "camera_target": [
        0.22,
        0.752,
        0.141
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.4,
      "transition_style": "cut",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "55cbdaa654f58b6f738753c0b8a3ef7bff72f86a37c2c81474968f496a299700"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L010",
      "frame_id": "CH03_P04_F06",
      "panel_id": "p34_new_hero",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "spoken_text": "I would like to introduce my son, the prince of our people. I propose that he travel with you.",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch03_clips/en/CH03_P04_L010_en.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 6.191,
      "camera_target": [
        0.21,
        0.776,
        0.142
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.25,
      "transition_style": "pan",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "09c3b90188b6cd1f3a6eed7cbd168060f52849277fa736f328a061fd863189c0"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L011",
      "frame_id": "CH03_P04_F07",
      "panel_id": "p34_ship_departure",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "spoken_text": "I cannot answer your questions about your home planet, Mika. But I will help you continue onward—to the Barnard Galaxy.",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch03_clips/en/CH03_P04_L011_en.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 7.393,
      "camera_target": [
        0.69,
        0.805,
        0.218
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.4,
      "transition_style": "cut",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "0009c429a71120b61637464cf3aa7d0b6ad2f16caaf87b705fdf53323e98dd51"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L012",
      "frame_id": "CH03_P04_F07",
      "panel_id": "p34_ship_departure",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "spoken_text": "But be careful: there are many pirates there!",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch03_clips/en/CH03_P04_L012_en.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 3.239,
      "camera_target": [
        0.69,
        0.846,
        0.218
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.25,
      "transition_style": "pan",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
